namespace main
primitive checker, result, success, failure, count
[F] When the checker receives a result R, the checker shall follow this flow:
    step inspect: read R;
    step good: publish the success for R;
    step bad: publish the failure for R;
    start inspect
    choose after inspect:
        when the count is at least 2 -> good
        when the count is at most 0 -> bad
    finish good
    finish bad
